<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="NEH" style="id">- Selee Old Testament</book>
  <para style="h">Nehemia</para>
  <para style="toc1">Nehemia Kukũ</para>
  <para style="toc2">Nehemia</para>
  <para style="toc3">Neh</para>
  <para style="mt2">NEHEMIA</para>
  <para style="mt1">Kukũ</para>
  <para style="imt">Odikiotuo</para>
  <para style="im">
    <char style="bk">Baafuo Nehemia kukũ nwu</char> ɔsɛ di akyuu ana: (1) Nehemia ɔpɛ okple ɔwa Yerusalem, lɛba le di Persia batii ɔka lakpee nwɔ alɛ alaaleko ni Yuda batii katũ. (2) Yerusalem seyoyiɛ ose-letofo. (3) Esra lamufũ Yaa Kufiofa nwu ɔka aaklee osie kanya, ni di batii nwu ladiki sikpile lɛma baabuɛ nɛ. (4) Nehemia sɛsaabla se aabla aakyakaa ni fɛ Yuda abaa Kanyayilatɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Lɛba finle bɛɛtɛ ni nsũ di kukũ nwu ninle Nehemia disi otika di Yaa suoto osie kanya ku ɔlaa nɔɔ ɔpɛ ɔtɔtɔɔ ni obe lele.</para>
  <para style="iot">Kukũ Nwu Kamɛ Sɛlaa</para>
  <para style="io1">Nehemia ɔpɛ okple ɔwa Yerusalem <char style="ior"><ref loc="NEH 1:1-2:20">1.1—2.20</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Baase Yerusalem seyoyiɛ letofo <char style="ior"><ref loc="NEH 3:1-7:73">3.1—7.73</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Baaka Kufiofa nwu, ni baase kanya ninii nwu lɛbla nɛ <char style="ior"><ref loc="NEH 8:1-10:39">8.1—10.39</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Nehemia sɛsaabla se aabla aakyakaa nii <char style="ior"><ref loc="NEH 11:1-13:31">11.1—13.31</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="NEH 1" />
  <para style="s1">Nehemia Ɔlaa Ɔpɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 1:1" />Hakalia obisuɔtɔbi Nehemia sɛlaa ninle nse mmle nɛ:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 1:1" />
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 1:1">Di Yuda batii kɔwɛntɛ ko manlɛɛ ni Kislew<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kɔwɛntɛ nwu ninle kɔnaasinle di Babilonia awɛntɛ kamɛ nɛ, ku le ni kɔwɛntɛ lefosi kunwii ntɛɛ ku lefosi kɔnyɔɔfa ntɛɛ.</char></note> kamɛ, di alɛɛ afosi-anyɔ kamɛ, di obe wɔ lawɛ ni di Susa okpoo katanikokɔ nwu yi, <verse eid="NEH 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 1:2" />ni di Hanani, babiloo-suɔtɔbi onwii lakye Yuda aawa ku basuɔtɔ bamba bawo, ni lakaalɛ ma ɔlaa lakyeko Yuda batii balanle ba niabu baasiɛ ni nkpa, ku Yerusalem batii kafɔɔ nɛ.<verse eid="NEH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 1:3" />Ni baatɔkɔ mi alɛ, “Batii ba niawɛ ni nkpa di sɛlanle kamɛ, batookple bɛɛwa ni kasɔ nwu nfɛ nsi di dibuo kplɛ ku sinunsɔ kamɛ. Yerusalem oyoyiɛ ntoobiɛ kute kaasɔ, beefiɛ kafɔɔ n-yoko ninwu ku ɔtɔ.”<verse eid="NEH 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 1:4" />Lanu ni sɛlaa se mmle yi, ni lataba kaasɔ lawi nɛ. Lawi kaku, lanii kanya, ni lapɛ ɔlaa di Yaa wɔ di osi anu di ayi awo kamɛ nɛ. <verse eid="NEH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 1:5" />Ninfɛ labuɛ nlɛ:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="NEH 1:5">“Oo SAATE, Yaa wɔ di osi, Yaa kplɛ ku nnwɔ di lɛyɛkɛ nsi ni, nnwɔ ninklee ni lɛbɔmbɔ kanya ninii ku batii ba nimbɔmbɔ nwɔ ni, mankyɔɔ ni afiofa nɔɔ kotoko, <verse eid="NEH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 1:6" />ta atoko lɛfɔ ate kaayi di anu lɛfɔ kafɔɔ atikiti, aanu kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ ɔlaa ɔpɛ wɔ ɔɔpɛ ni di anu lɛfɔ kakũ ku kakyɛ anta ni bakpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ, Israel batii nwu. Kodiki sikpile se di awo Israel batii, di ami omu ku teemi leyo kamɛ batii nkyakaa nii, buabla ni di suoto lɛfɔ mbuɛ. <verse eid="NEH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 1:7" />Buadiki kɔkpaa kpile osie kanya di suoto lɛfɔ. Butakyɔɔ ɔlaa lɛfɔ atoko, bukyɛ di sisuku lɛfɔ, butale kafɔɔ afiofa ya faata ni kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ Mose.<verse eid="NEH 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 1:8" />“Nyuma ɔlaa wɔ faata ni kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ Mose, faabuɛ ni falɛ, ‘Nse bieele onukwale yi, kamasamiisa ye nkpee di nnle nwu kamɛ, <verse eid="NEH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 1:9" />kafɔɔ nse biekple biɛwa ɔkyɛ nii, biɛkyɔɔ sɛlaa nii atoko, ni bia nse balanle lee nkpe di kasɔ ku kolo nkyakakɔ fanfa yi, ni kamasiisa ma nkyeko nfa, nkpaa ma nwako lɛba le lediki nlɛ Leyooto nii dite nii.’<verse eid="NEH 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 1:10" />“Bakpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ ku batii lɛfɔ bale, mba faadiki ni ku osie kplɛ lɛfɔ ku kɔnɛɛ lɛfɔ siene. <verse eid="NEH 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 1:11" />Oo Saate, ta atoko lɛfɔ ate kaayi aanu kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ wɔ mmle ɔlaa ɔpɛ ku bakpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ ba ninnya ni suoto lɛyɔɔ manta ni leyooto lɛfɔ dibu ɔlaa ɔpɛ.Ta dilɛ dita kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ miɛ, faale nwɔ sibualɛ di osuɔtɔ wɔ mmle anu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 1:11">Ami niale nta nyɛɛnɛtɛ lata ɔka nɛ.<verse eid="NEH 1:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="NEH 2" />
  <para style="s1">Nehemia Lakyɛ Yerusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 2:1" />Di Ɔka Artasasta alɛɛ afosi-anyɔ kamɛ, di Yuda batii kɔwɛntɛ ko manlɛɛ ni Nisan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kɔwɛntɛ ko mmle ninle kɔkasale di Babilonia batii awɛntɛ kamɛ nɛ, diɛyɔ ni di kɔwɛntɛ tiɛfa ntɛɛ diɛlaase ni di kwɛntɛ naafa ntɛɛ</char></note> kamɛ, di obe wɔ baawako ni ɔka nta yi, ni layɔ nta nwu lata ɔka nɛ. Diidii nimbla biɔɔ di anu nɔɔ; <verse eid="NEH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 2:2" />nioso ɔka nwu lakaalɛ mi alɛ, “Obe oso di anu lɛfɔ lɛbla biɔɔ nkpo, di obe wɔ fonoofiɛ ni? Nle mmle diele lɛsalɛsaa kafɔɔ, otu kamɛ sɛnyaami dile.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 2:2">Layɛkɛ osie kanya, <verse eid="NEH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 2:3" />kafɔɔ latɔkɔ ɔka nlɛ, “Ɔka asiɛ nkpa dinaa ni kaloo! Obe oso di anu nii dilaabla biɔɔ, di obe wɔ di okpoo kplɛ wɔ baakookaa ni bate nii ntoobiɛ ni, di ɔtɔ kafɔɔ ntoofiɛ ni n-yoko ninwu?”<verse eid="NEH 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 2:4" />Ni di ɔka nwu lakaalɛ mi alɛ, “Obe ninle nle foomiɛ ni?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 2:4">Ninfɛ lapɛ ɔlaa lata Yaa nwu di osi nɛ, <verse eid="NEH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 2:5" />ni latɔkɔ ɔka nwu nlɛ, “Nse diɛyɔɔ ɔka kafutu di kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ kafɔɔ kawɛ sibualɛ di anu nɔɔ yi, ni ɔka aakpee mi okpoo kplɛ nwu di Yuda, di nfũ baakookaa ni bate nii alɛ kakple nsè nwu letofo.”<verse eid="NEH 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 2:6" />Ninfɛ di ɔka nwu, di ɔka-sanko lasiɛ nwɔ ni di ɔlɔɔkɔ, lakaalɛ mi alɛ, “Lɛ di osuku lɛfɔ ɔkyɛ kamaklɛ? Ɔmɛmbe kafɔɔ fabakple fanwa?” Diayɔɔ ɔka kafutu alɛ okpee mi; nioso latɛ obe.<verse eid="NEH 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 2:7" />Ni latɔkɔ nwɔ kafɔɔ nlɛ, “Nse diɛyɔɔ ɔka kafutu yi, ni atɛɛ akũ nkyɛnko abaa kanyabayilatɛ nwu di Okle-Kamaa, alɛ baatɛɛ osuku nfe buɛɛ nnaabuo Yuda. <verse eid="NEH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 2:8" />Ni faatɛɛ kukũ kafɔɔ nkyɛnko ɔka lepoo nyuntɛ Asaf, alɛ aatɛɛ awoso mbɛ sewoso nta kaTiNiKoKɔ nwu di olekatakɔ ɔlɔɔkɔ n-yoko ku okpoo kplɛ nwu seyoyiɛ ku leyo le kamasiɛ nii.” Ta di Yaa nii sibualɛ kɔnɛɛ latika mi ni di suoto oso yi, ɔka nwu latɛɛ asaa ya lakaalɛ nii. <verse eid="NEH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 2:9" />Nioso lakyɛ abaa kanyabayilatɛ nwu nfũ di Okle-Kamaa, ni lalaayɔ ɔka akũ nwu lata ma nɛ. Ɔka kafɔɔ lakpee bakpɛtɛ ku bapɔnkɔ basiɛtɛ latikankoe.<verse eid="NEH 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 2:10" />Obe wɔ di Sanbalat, Horon otii nwu ku Tobia, Amon otii ɔnɔɔfotii nwu lanu ni nle mmle yi, diakpee ma kubuɛ osie kanya alɛ otii owo ntɔɔwa alɛ ɔɔbatakatɛ Israel batii disi katoo.<verse eid="NEH 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nehemia Lanyunyuu Yerusalem Seyoyiɛ Nwu Aafenko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 2:11" />Ni lakyɛ Yerusalem nɛ, lasiɛ ninfa ayi atiɛ, <verse eid="NEH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 2:12" />ni ladie ku kakyɛ munko basuɔtɔ basɛɛ nɛ. Ntatɔkɔ kuonwii lɛsaa le di Yaa nii layɔ aakpee mi ni di otu alɛ mbla nta ni Yerusalem. Bapɔnkɔ ku-banwii ditawɛ di ɔkyɛ nii, dilenkee onwii wɔ suoto lasiɛ nii.<verse eid="NEH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 2:13" />Di kakyɛ ladie lafe di Ɔtaata Kayoko diofe ni di Kɔsanwu Ntu Dibiɔ ku Lefleku Kayoko, lanyunyu Yerusalem seyoyiɛ se niabiɛ siate ni, ku n-yoko nɔɔ be di ɔtɔ lafiɛ nii. <verse eid="NEH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 2:14" />Ninfɛ lakple lakyɛ sitũ diofe ni Ntu Kataakɔ Kayoko ku Ɔka Ntu Lɛpanta nwu, kafɔɔ lɛba nwu dita blɛfɛ di pɔnkɔ nii kafuo ni ofe; <verse eid="NEH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 2:15" />nioso lakata lakyɛ ɔtaata nwu ku kakyɛ, lalaanyunyu oyoyiɛ nwu. Di kayɛntɛkɔ, lapɛ lakple sɛmaa, ni lalaase dibuo ofe di Ɔtaata Kayoko nɛ. <verse eid="NEH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 2:16" />Banɔɔfotii nwu ditatofo fɛ lafe ee lɛsaa le latɔɔbla nii, diekye di obe nwu nimbuɛ ɔlaa kuonwii ntɔkɔ Yuda batii ee olebatatɛ ee banɔɔfo ee banɔɔfotii ee batii bamba ba nimabla ni ɔkpɛ nwu.<verse eid="NEH 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 2:17" />Ni latɔkɔ ma nlɛ, “Biɔnya dibuo le kamɛ busi ni: Yerusalem ntoobiɛ, bɛɛfiɛ n-yoko ninwu kafɔɔ ku ɔtɔ. Biwa, biɛta buse Yerusalem oyoyiɛ letofo, ni buloosinwa ɔbasiɛ di sinunsɔ kamɛ.” <verse eid="NEH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 2:18" />Latɔkɔ ma kafɔɔ mmle di Yaa nii sibualɛ kɔnɛɛ ntika mi ni di suoto ku ɔlaa wɔ di ɔka latɔkɔ mi nii.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 2:18">Ni baadiki kanya alɛ, “Bita bukyekasɔ buose otootofo.” Nioso baakye ɔkpɛ biene wɔ mmle kasɔ.<verse eid="NEH 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 2:19" />Kafɔɔ obe wɔ di Sanbalat, Horon otii nwu, Tobia Amon otii ɔnɔɔfotii nwu ku Gesem, Arabia otii nwu lanu nwu ni ole yi, baama wo, baanyu wo nyakatãa. Ni baakaalɛ alɛ, “Obe ninle nle biɔbla ni nɛ? Ɔtaka biɔtaka min-yila di ɔka suoto nɛ?”<verse eid="NEH 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 2:20" />Ni ladiki kanya latɔkɔ ma nlɛ, “Yaa wɔ di Osi kamata ɔkpɛ nwu n-lɛ wo ɔbla. Awo bakpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ bubakyekasɔ munse letootofo, kafɔɔ aye yi, binaa kalekɔ kukanwii di Yerusalem ee biwɛ lɛsalɛsaa kuninwii ee biwɛ osuku di saa sɛsaabla suoto.”<verse eid="NEH 2:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="NEH 3" />
  <para style="s1">Yerusalem Oyoyiɛ Nwu Ose Letofo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 3:1" />Ninfɛ di oletatɛ-nɔɔfo Eliasib ku olebatatɛ wo nɔɔ lakyɛ baalaabla ɔkpɛ baase Bafoso Kayoko nwu letofo nɛ. Baakleklesa ni, baakpee akloo di aba ninya. Baatofo baalaadu bia lɛba le bɔɔlɛɛ ni leyo Takale Kɔlafa, ni baakleklesa nwu dialaadu kafɔɔ Hananel Leyo Takale nwu nɛ. <verse eid="NEH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 3:2" />Yeriko basuɔtɔ latofo oyoyiɛ wɔ niatikanko nwu nii, ni di Imri obisuɔtɔbi Sakur kafɔɔ latofo di ɔlɔɔkɔ lɛma nɛ.<verse eid="NEH 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 3:3" />Hasena babisuɔtɔbi niase Kɔkpaku Kayoko nwu letofo. Baatika sewoso nini, baakpee akloo ku abɔɔsaa akɔnii ku abɔɔsaa sewoso di aba ninya. <verse eid="NEH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 3:4" />Uria obisuɔtɔbi Meremot, aale ni Hakkos ɔwa nialolaa kakyɛ ka nintikanko nii. Nnwɔɔ kamaa Berekia obisuɔtɔbi Mesulam, aale ni Mesesabel ɔwa nialolaa, nnwɔɔ kamaa Bana obisuɔtɔbi Sadok kafɔɔ lalolaa. <verse eid="NEH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 3:5" />Tekoa basuɔtɔ nialolaa kakyɛ ka niatikanko nii, kafɔɔ banɔɔfotii lɛma ditakpee nnɛɛ babla ɔkpɛ nwu di kanyu lɛma kalɔ.<verse eid="NEH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 3:6" />Pasea obisuɔtɔbi Yoiada ku Besodeia obisuɔtɔbi Mesulam lalolaa Yesana Kayoko. Baatika sewoso nini, baakpee akloo ku abɔɔsaa akɔnii ku abɔɔsaa sewoso di aba ninya. <verse eid="NEH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 3:7" />Mma kamaa, Gibeon ku Mispa basuɔtɔ nialolaa nwu- Melatia wɔ niakye ni Gibeon ku Yadon wɔ niakye ni Meronot- aba ya niasiɛ ni di Okle-kamaa abaa kanyayilatɛ otumi kalɔ nialolaa nfa. <verse eid="NEH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 3:8" />Harhaia obisuɔtɔbi Usiel, niale ni koto sɛɛle asaablatɛ onwii lɛma, lalolaa kakyɛ ka niatikanko nii; ni di Hanania, nnɔnyi kɔnɔnkɔnɔ-bablatɛ onwii lɛma lalolaa di nninkpo sɛmaa nɛ. Baase Yerusalem letofo dialaadu Oyoyiɛ Blɛfɛɛ nwu. <verse eid="NEH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 3:9" />Hur obisuɔtɔbi Rafaia, Yerusalem kale dikudi kakyɛ kanyayilatɛ lalolaa kakyɛ ka niatikanko nii. <verse eid="NEH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 3:10" />Di otofo ɔkyakaa di nle mmle yi, Harumaf obisuɔtɔbi Yedaia lalolaa kakyɛ ka niakyɔɔ ni anu leyo nɔɔ, ni di Hasabneia obisuɔtɔbi Hatus lalolaa aatikanko nwɔ nɛ. <verse eid="NEH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 3:11" />Harim obisuɔtɔbi Malkiya ku Pahat-Moab obisuɔtɔbi Hasub lalolaa kakyɛ bamba ku Ablobloyo Leyo Takale nwu. <verse eid="NEH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 3:12" />Halohes obisuɔtɔbi Salum niale ni Yerusalem dikudi-kakyɛ kanyayilatɛ lalolaa kakyɛ ka niatikanko nii, ku babisankobi nɔɔ lɛkyakaako.<verse eid="NEH 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 3:13" />Hanun ku batii ba niasiɛ ni di Sanoa lalolaa Ɔtaata Kayoko nwu. Baase ni letofo, baakpee akloo nini ku abɔɔsaa nkɔnii ku abɔɔsaa sewoso di aba ninya. Baalolaa kafɔɔ oyoyiɛ nkpaa kakpe alafa-anɔɔ dialaadu Lefleku Kayoko nwu.<verse eid="NEH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 3:14" />Rakab obisuɔtɔbi Malkiya wɔ niale ni Bet Hakerem kale dikudi tunletɛ nialolaa Lefleku Kayoko nwu. Aase ni letofo, aakpee akloo nini ku abɔɔsaa nkɔnii ku abɔɔsaa sewoso di aba ninya.<verse eid="NEH 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 3:15" />Kol-Hose obisuɔtɔbi Salum wɔ niale ni Mispa kale dikudi kanyayilatɛ niatofo Ntu Kataakɔ Kayoko nwu. Aase ni letofo, aaba ni, aakpee akloo ninya ku abɔɔsaa nkɔnii ku abɔɔsaa sewoso di aba ninya. Aalolaa kafɔɔ Lɛpanta oyoyiɛ nwu di Siloa di Ɔka Kɔba ɔlɔɔkɔ, dialaadu nkatakɔ be niesoo diekye ni Dawid Okpoo kplɛ nwu. <verse eid="NEH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 3:16" />Nnwɔɔ kamaa yi, Asbuk obisuɔtɔbi Nehemia wɔ niale ni Bet-Sur kale dikudi-kakyɛ kanyayilatɛ lalolaa aalaadu lɛba le niakyɔɔ ni Dawid ɔkya anu, dialaadu Bakpɛtɛ Leyo ku lɛpanta le baakutu nii.<verse eid="NEH 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lewi Batii Ba Niabla Ni Ɔkpɛ Di Oyoyiɛ Nwu Suoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 3:17" />Nnwɔɔ kamaa, Bani obisuɔtɔbi Rehum layila di Lewi batii kanya baalolaa oyoyiɛ nwu. Nnwɔɔ kamaa, Hasabia wɔ niale ni Keila kale dikudi-kakyɛ kanyayilatɛ lalolaa aata kale dikudi nɔɔ. <verse eid="NEH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 3:18" />Nnwɔɔ kamaa, Hanadad obisuɔtɔbi Binui niale ni Keila kale dikudi-kakyɛ nyɔɔfa kanyayilatɛ layila di kale lɛma basuɔtɔ kanya baatofo oyoyiɛ nwu. <verse eid="NEH 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 3:19" />Nnwɔɔ kamaa, Yesua obisuɔtɔbi Eser wɔ niale ni Mispa kanyayilatɛ lalolaa oyoyiɛ nwu kakyɛ bamba, diayɔ ni di lɛba le niakyɔɔ ni akpɛsaa katɛkɔ nkatakɔ anu dialaadu ni oyoyiɛ nwu lɛkɔ. <verse eid="NEH 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 3:20" />Nnwɔɔ kamaa, Sabai obisuɔtɔbi Baruk layɔ okyĩini aalolaa kakyɛ bamba, diayɔ ni di lɛkɔ nwu dialaadu ni oletatɛ-nɔɔfo Eliasib leyo kayoko. <verse eid="NEH 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 3:21" />Nnwɔɔ kamaa, Uria obisuɔtɔbi Meremot, aale ni Hakos ɔwa, lalolaa kakyɛ bamba, diayɔ ni di Eliasib leyo kayoko dialaase ni di kayɛntɛkɔ nini.<verse eid="NEH 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Olebatatɛ Ba Niabla Ni Ɔkpɛ Di Oyoyiɛ Nwu Suoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 3:22" />Olebatatɛ ba niakye ni nsɔ be niakaako ma ni lalolaa oyoyiɛ wɔ niakaako nwɔ nii. <verse eid="NEH 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 3:23" />Mma kamaa, Benyamin ku Hasub lalolaa oyoyiɛ nwu di leyo lɛma anu; ni di mma kamaa, Maaseia obisuɔtɔbi Asaria wɔ niale ni Anania ɔwa lalolaa oyoyiɛ nwu di leyo nɔɔ ɔlɔɔkɔ nɛ. <verse eid="NEH 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 3:24" />Nnwɔɔ kamaa, Henadad obisuɔtɔbi Binui lalolaa kakyɛ bamba, diayɔ ni di Asaria leyo dialaase ni di oyoyiɛ nwu lɛkɔ ku leyokɔ, <verse eid="NEH 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 3:25" />ni di Usai obisuɔtɔbi Palal labla ɔkpɛ aakyɔɔ anu oyoyiɛ nwu lɛkɔ ku leyo takale nwu niatuunii diakye ni lɛkayo nwu katoo diakaako ni asaa banyuntɛ kaflɔnkɔ. Nnwɔɔ kamaa, Paros obisuɔtɔbi Pedaia <verse eid="NEH 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 3:26" />ku olekatakɔ bakpɛmblatɛ ba niasiɛ ni di Ofel akpenkpe nwu lalolaa baalaadu lɛba le niakyɔɔ ni Ntu Kayoko anu diofe ni di kufĩ katunkɔ ku leyo takale tuuniile nwu.<verse eid="NEH 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Batofotɛ Bamba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 3:27" />Mma kamaa, Tekoa batii lalolaa kakyɛ bamba, diayɔ ni di leyo takale kplɛ tuuniile nwu dialaadu di Ofel oyoyiɛ.<verse eid="NEH 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NEH 3:28" />Diayɔ ni di Pɔnkɔ Kayoko diesifi nii, olebatatɛ nialolaa oyoyiɛ nwu, obiala di leyo nɔɔ nimu anu. <verse eid="NEH 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NEH 3:29" />Mma kamaa, Imer obisuɔtɔbi Sadok lalolaa oyoyiɛ wɔ niakyɔɔ ni leyo nɔɔ anu. Nnwɔɔ kamaa, Sekania obisuɔtɔbi Semaia wɔ niale ni kayoko nyuntɛ di Kufĩ Katunkɔ Kayoko lalolaa oyoyiɛ nwu. <verse eid="NEH 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NEH 3:30" />Nnwɔɔ kamaa, Selemia obisuɔtɔbi Hanania ku Hanun wɔ niale ni Salaf obisuɔtɔbi kuɔnle, lalolaa kakyɛ bamba. Mma kamaa, Berekia obisuɔtɔbi Mesulam lalolaa oyoyiɛ wɔ niakyɔɔ ni ayo nɔɔ ya aasiɛ ni anu. <verse eid="NEH 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NEH 3:31" />Nnwɔɔ kamaa, Malkiya, koto sɛɛle asaablatɛ onwii lɛma, lalolaa oyoyiɛ nwu dialaadu olekatakɔ bakpɛmblatɛ leyo ku asaa basunsũtɛ, diakyɔɔ ni Kanyunyu Kayoko anu, dialaadu leyo le di leyokɔ osi. <verse eid="NEH 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NEH 3:32" />Di leyo le di leyokɔ ku Bafoso Kayoko obo yi, koto sɛɛle asaablatɛ ku asaa basunsũtɛ nialolaa oyoyiɛ nwu.<verse eid="NEH 3:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="NEH 4" />
  <para style="s1">Nehemia Lalenkee Batii Ba Niataka Baayila Ni Di Ɔkpɛ Nɔɔ Suoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 4:1" />Obe wɔ di Sanbalat lanu alɛ buose ni oyoyiɛ nwu letofo yi, ɔblɔ lafiɛ nwɔ yakayaka osie kanya. Aatɛ Yuda batii kaasɔ, <verse eid="NEH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 4:2" />di bakpɛntɛ wo nɔɔ ku Samaria bakpɛtɛ anu aabuɛ alɛ, “Obe lɛsaa di Yuda batii ba mmle di ɔnyɛɛ nnaa ni kɔbla nɛ? Babase oyoyiɛ lɛma nwu letofo? Babata seleɔta? Babaloo nwu otofo dii ninwii? Babafuo afuɔ nwu okplesa ɔwako nkpa kamɛ, di atɛnkudi ya beesiisa- beefiɛ nya ni fɛ mmle ate ni?”<verse eid="NEH 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 4:3" />Tobia, Amon otii nwu niawɛ ni di ɔlɔɔkɔ nɔɔ labuɛ alɛ, “Lɛsaa le bootofo nii-nse bia lepoo kamɛ ɔklá leyie nwu di suoto yi, ababiɛ afuɔ oyoyiɛ lɛma nwu antɛ kaasɔ!”<verse eid="NEH 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 4:4" />Oo Yaa loo, nu wo ɔlaa, diekye bɛɛtɛ wo kaasɔ. Munikĩisa atufa lɛma nwu fatika di mma bamu lɛma asintɛɛ. Yɔ ma fata fɛ kakpɛ kamɛ asaa di sɛlanle kasɔ suoto. <verse eid="NEH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 4:5" />Tantitĩi lɛpɔɔ okpi lɛma ee fayɛɛsa sikpile lɛma fakyisa di anu lɛfɔ, diekye batookpete atufa di ayo batofotɛ lɛfɔ anu.<verse eid="NEH 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 4:6" />Nioso buase oyoyiɛ nwu letofo, di omuu lɛtaka ninwu ladu ni ɔfã, diekye batii nwu labla ɔkpɛ nwu ku otu lɛma omuu.<verse eid="NEH 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 4:7" />Kafɔɔ obe wɔ di Sanbalat, Tobia ku Arab batii, Amon batii ku Asdod batii lanu alɛ Yerusalem seyoyiɛ nwu ololaa ntɔɔkyɛ ni sitũ, ni nfɛ bootĩi ni sebo nwu kafɔɔ yi, ɔblɔ lafiɛ ma osie kanya. <verse eid="NEH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 4:8" />Ni baasi baakũ kanwumbe alɛ bɔɔkyɛ manaakpɛko Yerusalem mankpee nwu kudu kafɔɔ nɛ. <verse eid="NEH 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 4:9" />Kafɔɔ buapɛ ɔlaa buata Yaa loo, ni buadiki banyuntɛ buase kakũ ku kakyɛ, alɛ buafuo difunaa le mmle odieko.<verse eid="NEH 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 4:10" />Kafɔɔ, batii ba di Yuda labuɛ alɛ, “Ɔnyɛɛ nfɛ koloo ɔkpɛ bablatɛ nwu, ayiɛkuu kpinwu kafɔɔ nte bulɔbafuo ni oyoyiɛ nwu ose letofo.”<verse eid="NEH 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 4:11" />Diɛkyakaa ni kafɔɔ yi, balo loo labuɛ alɛ, “Fiɛ babatofo nii ee man-nya wo ni yi, nfɛ busi ma kaamɛ munlo ma mun-ta ɔkpɛ nwu ndiɛ ɔbla.”<verse eid="NEH 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 4:12" />Ninfɛ di Yuda batii ba niasiɛ baakaako ma ni lawa baabatɔkɔ wo dialenkee lefosi alɛ, “ Kakɔ lele biemunikĩi yi, babadieko wo.”<verse eid="NEH 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 4:13" />Nioso ladiki batii bawo lase di oyoyiɛ wɔ niawakasɔ kualenkee ni sɛmaa, di aba ya niate ni temple, lase ma di ayo-ayo kanya, ku mpamii, akplɔ ku ataa lɛma. <verse eid="NEH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 4:14" />Sɛmaa lanyu asaa lafenko nii, lataka layila ni latɔkɔ banɔɔfo-kplɛ, banɔɔfotii ku batii nwu bule nlɛ, “Bitan-yɛkɛ ma. Binyuma SAATE nwu, nnwɔ niemuɔ ni di lɛyɛkɛ nsi ni, biɛkpɛ bita basuɔtɔbi lee, babisuɔtɔbi lee ku babisankobi lee, basɔfɔ lee ku ayo lee.”<verse eid="NEH 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 4:15" />Obe wɔ di balo loo lanu alɛ buye ni kanwumbe okũ lɛma nwu, di Yaa kafɔɔ ntɔɔkpɔtɔɔsa ka ni yi, bamuu loo buapɛ buakple buasifi oyoyiɛ nwu katofokɔ, obiala lasifi ɔkpɛ nɔɔ omu kamɛ.<verse eid="NEH 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 4:16" />Diayɔ ni di dii nwu nkpo diasifi nii, batii nii kakyɛ kanwii latɔɔbla ɔkpɛ nwu, ni baata kakyɛ bamba kafɔɔ laklee akplɔ, kubiafunsaa, kɔtaa ku akpɛsaa nɛ. Banɔɔfotii nwu layila Yuda batii nwu bamuu kamaa, <verse eid="NEH 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 4:17" />mba niatootofo ni oyoyiɛ nwu. Batii ba niatootuka ni leyo atofosaa labla ɔkpɛ lɛma ku kɔnɛɛ kunwii, baaklee kafɔɔ lɛkpɛsaa di kɔnɛɛ nyɔɔfa, <verse eid="NEH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 4:18" />leyo-tofotɛ biala kafɔɔ lakpakũ kapamii di ɔfankyi nɔɔ di obe wɔ ɔɔbla ni ɔkpɛ. Kafɔɔ osuɔtɔ wɔ niatɔɔfɛ ni kakyukyue lawɛ di ɔkyɛ nii.<verse eid="NEH 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 4:19" />Ninfɛ labuɛ latɔkɔ banɔɔfo-kplɛ, banɔɔfotii ku batii bule nwu nlɛ, “Ɔkpɛ nwu mpɔ, kuɔblɛfɛ kafɔɔ, ni bɔɔblá baawo foo di oyoyiɛ nwu suoto nɛ. <verse eid="NEH 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 4:20" />Kakɔlele bienu kakyukyue nwu sɛlɔ, biɛbakyakaa di awo ninfa. Yaa loo kamakpɛ anta wo.”<verse eid="NEH 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 4:21" />Nioso buakyɛ sitũ buatɔɔbla ɔkpɛ nwu ku batii kakyɛ ka niaklee ni akplɔ, nin-yɔ ni di kolesɛtũ lɛkpa kasale ninnaase di obe wɔ di awɛntrɛbi ndie nii. <verse eid="NEH 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 4:22" />Di obe nwu kamɛ kafɔɔ latɔkɔ batii nwu nlɛ, “Bita osuɔtɔ biala ku kyakaakotɛ nɔɔ asiɛ di Yerusalem kamɛ ku kakyɛ, di mmle biafuo ni banyuntɛ ole ku kakyɛ manle ni bakpɛntɛ kafɔɔ ku anu nwaa.” <verse eid="NEH 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 4:23" />Ami ee basuɔtɔbi loo ee bakpɛmblatɛ nii ee banyuntɛ nwu di ɔkyɛ nii ditadiki akpeele loo di suoto; obiala laklee lɛkpɛsaa nɔɔ, bia nse ɛɛkyɛ ntu okusii.<verse eid="NEH 4:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="NEH 5" />
  <para style="s1">Bapiitɛ Onyinka Ɔtɛ Kaasɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 5:1" />Di obe owo sɛmaa basuɔtɔ ku basɔfɔ lɛma lafaa osie kanya baayila di babilɛma-suɔtɔbi Yuda batii suoto. <verse eid="NEH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 5:2" />Bawo latoobuɛ alɛ, “Awo ku babisuɔtɔbi loo ku babisankobi loo mpɔ; dikpeni buɔwɛ alesaa, di mmle bubale munsiɛ ni nkpa.”<verse eid="NEH 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 5:3" />Bawo latoobuɛ alɛ, “Buɔyɔ afe loo, awosobi loo afe ku ayo loo buose kamaa buofũ alesaa di kɔka obe kamɛ.”<verse eid="NEH 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 5:4" />Babamba kafɔɔ lakple baatoobuɛ alɛ, “Ɔfɛnsa buɔfɛnsa ato buɔta ɔka akpooto di afe ku awosobi afe loo suoto. <verse eid="NEH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 5:5" />Nu di suoto sina sinwii ku ntɔ nnwii bule fɛ okpoo loo batii yi, di babi loo kafɔɔ nlɛ fɛ balema, kafɔɔ buayɔ babisuɔtɔbi loo ku babisankobi loo buata sɛlanle ole. Batoole katũ bɛɛbla babisankobi loo bawo balanle kofokofoko, kafɔɔ awo bunaa ɔnyɛɛ kuonwii, diekye afe loo ku awosobi loo afe nle batii bamba ale.”<verse eid="NEH 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 5:6" />Obe wɔ lanu ni lɛfaa ku sɛlaa lɛma nwu yi, ɔblɔ lafiɛ mi osie kanya. <verse eid="NEH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 5:7" />Labu ma disi, ni layɔ ɔlaa di banɔɔfo-kplɛ ku banɔɔfotii nwu suoto nɛ. Ni latɔkɔ ma nlɛ, “Biotufu okpoo lee omu batii ato!” Nioso lalɛɛ batii nwu lasiisa dikudi lablako ɔlaa nwu ɔkpɛ <verse eid="NEH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 5:8" />ni labuɛ nlɛ: “Fɛ mmle butookpee ni okyiini yi, butɔɔya babiloo Yuda batii ba baasunsũ baata ni batii ba ninanle ni Yuda batii buokplesa buɔwako. Nunua nfɛ biosunsũ babilee-suɔtɔbi, mankple mansunsũ ma manta wo!” Baalo kanana, diekye batawɛ ɔlaa kuonwii baabuɛ nii.<verse eid="NEH 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 5:9" />Nioso lakyɛ sitũ latɔkɔ ma nlɛ, “Lɛsaa le biɔbla ni diɛlɛ. Bilaakyɛ di Yaa loo lɛyɛkɛ kamɛ, alɛ bulɔbata osuku balo loo ba ninanle ni Yuda batii bama wo? <verse eid="NEH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 5:10" />Ami ku babiloo-suɔtɔbi ku batii nii kafɔɔ kɔta batii koto ku atitabi manfɛnsa. Kafɔɔ bita ato otufu nwu kuse! <verse eid="NEH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 5:11" />Bikplesa afe, awosobi afe, nnɔnyi awoso afe ku ayo lɛma bita ma wla, ku ato ya biotikasa minta ma bilɛ bata ni- ale ni dikyuu kɔlafa le di koto, atitabi, nta fɔle ku nnɔnyi suoto.”<verse eid="NEH 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 5:12" />Ni di Batunletɛ nwu labuɛ alɛ, “Bubakplesa munta ma. Bulɔbasinkaalɛ kafɔɔ lɛsalɛsaa di ɔkyɛ lɛma bukyaakaa. Bubabla fɛ mmle feebuɛ nii.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 5:12">Ninfɛ lalɛɛ olebatatɛ nwu, lata banɔɔfotii-kplɛ ku banɔɔfotii nwu laka ntam alɛ bababla di nle baabuɛ alɛ bababla ni suoto nɛ. <verse eid="NEH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 5:13" />Ni latũkunsa kafɔɔ akpeele-wua nii nwu labuɛ nlɛ, “Yaa atũkunsa otii biala ninambla ni di ntam be mmle suoto adiki di leyo ku lɛsaawɛ nɔɔ kamɛ. Nkpo baatũkunsa otii nwu okle badiki aate ofukuti nɛ!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 5:13">Di nle mmle yi, batii nwu bamuu latuna alɛ, “Diwa kaanya,” baatansa SAATE nwu kafɔɔ. Ni di batii nwu labla fɛ mmle baaka ni ntam kanya nɛ.<verse eid="NEH 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nehemia Sifutulɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 5:14" />Kafɔɔ, diɛyɔ ni di Ɔka Artasasta alɛɛ afosi-anyɔ kamɛ, di obe wɔ baadiki mi alɛ nle ni abaa-ɔnɔɔfo lɛma di Yuda kasɔ suoto, diɛlaase ni di alɛɛ afosi-atiɛ lɛlɛɛ nyɔɔfa nɔɔ- di lefosi alɛɛ-anyɔ nintɔbafe nii yi- ami ee babiloo-suɔtɔbi kuonwii loo ditale alesaa ya manta ni abaa-ɔnɔɔfo. <verse eid="NEH 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 5:15" />Kafɔɔ abaa kanyabayilatɛ kasale- mba niawɛ ni fiɛ di ami lawa ni- latukasa batii nwu atoo nutũle ni baafũ koto fututu afosi-ana baakyakaa di alesaa ku nta baakyeko ɔkyɛ lɛma nɛ. Bakyakaakotɛ lɛma kafɔɔ lanyinka lanyika ni baatika di batii nwu suoto. Kafɔɔ ami dibu le layɔ lata ni Yaa oso ntabla nkpo. <verse eid="NEH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 5:16" />Kafɔɔ yi, layɔ suoto nii lata di oyoyiɛ wɔ mmle ɔkpɛ ɔbla suoto. Bakpɛmblatɛ nii bamuu lasi ninfa baata ɔkpɛ nwu; butafũ ni kasɔ kukanwii. <verse eid="NEH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 5:17" />Diɛkyakaa nii, Yuda batii ku banɔɔfotii kɔlafa afosi-anɔɔ ku mba kafɔɔ niawa ni ɔkyɛ loo baakye ni nnle be niɛmana wo diekyi ni lale alesaa di leyo nii nɛ. <verse eid="NEH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 5:18" />Alesaa ya manwa mantɛɛ ni dii biala niale, nankyue-suɔtɔ onwii, bafoso ba ninsi ni lɛla nwaa bakuɔ ku bakɔɔkɔ bawo, nta kafɔɔ nta ateate kpinwu di ayi lefosi biala kamɛ. Di n-ya mmle amuu kamɛ yi, diidii ntakaalɛ alesaa ya manta ni abaa-ɔnɔɔfo, diekye asaa nwu ofũ lale atoo nutũle di batii ba mmle suoto.<verse eid="NEH 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 5:19" />Oo Yaa nii, nyuma mi ku sibualɛ, di asaa ya amuu ntɔbla lɛta ni batii ba mmle.<verse eid="NEH 5:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="NEH 6" />
  <para style="s1">Kanwumbe Okũ Di Nehemia Suoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 6:1" />Di obe wɔ di kanya ladu ni Sanbalat, Tobia, Gesem, Arab otii nwu ku balo loo nwu bule alɛ ntoose ni oyoyiɛ nwu letofo di obo kuonwii kafɔɔ ditabu kute ni ninnwu suoto- kuntɛ dialaadu ni di obe nwu kamɛ ninadikpee ni akloo di n-yoko nwu yi- <verse eid="NEH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 6:2" />Sanbalat ku Gesem lakyesee mi kanya ka mmle alɛ: “Wa, fata bukyaka di sekponyii nwu onwii kamɛ di Ono kasɔ lakataa nwu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 6:2">Kafɔɔ baatookũ kanwumbe alɛ baabla mi dikpile. <verse eid="NEH 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 6:3" />Nioso lakpee ma batɔkyɛntɛ ku kanya didiki le mmle nlɛ: “Nkle ɔkpɛ kplɛ onwii kɔbla, nioso namafuo osoo ɔwa. Ɔkpɛ nwu dilɔbafuo oyila di obe wɔ kamadiɛ nwu nsoo nnwa ni ɔkyɛ lee.” <verse eid="NEH 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 6:4" />Sɛna simu baakyesee mi kanya nwu kanwii nwu, obe biala kafɔɔ nta ma kanya didiki kanwii nwu.<verse eid="NEH 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 6:5" />Ninfɛ di lɛnɔnle yi, Sanbalat lakpee mi kyakaakotɛ nɔɔ ku kanya nwu kanwii nwu, aklee kafɔɔ kukũ ko manantĩi ni kanya di kɔnɛɛ nɔɔ, <verse eid="NEH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 6:6" />baakpana kũ kaamɛ alɛ:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="NEH 6:6">“Batoobuɛ di nnle nwu kamɛ- Gesem kafɔɔ lebuɛ alɛ kute nkpo- alɛ afɔ ku Yuda batii kokũ kanwumbe bilɛ bibakpee kudu, nioso biotofo oyoyiɛ nwu nɛ. Diɛkyakaa nii, di sɛlaa se mmle kanya yi, nfɛ fɔɔwa ma ɔka ɔbale <verse eid="NEH 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 6:7" />ni bia fatoodiki ɔlaa babuɛtɛtɛ falɛ bayie lɛkya di suoto lɛfɔ di Yerusalem: ‘Ɔka nkpe di Yuda!’ Nunua yi, ɔlaa wɔ mmle kamapɛ kunkple kunaadu ɔka; nioso wa, faata wo bukpee asi baawo.”<verse eid="NEH 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 6:8" />Ni lakyesee nwɔ kanya didiki le mmle nlɛ: “Lɛsalɛsaa fɛle ɔlaa wɔ foobuɛ ni diete nkpo; disi lɛfɔ kamɛ ko foowola nwu fandiki.”<verse eid="NEH 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 6:9" />Bamuu lɛma latookpee kɔnyaabe alɛ bɔɔyɛkɛsa wo, boonyu alɛ, “Nnɛɛ lɛma kamawakasɔ di ɔkpɛ nwu suoto, ninta alɛ ɔkpɛ nwu dilɔbaloo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 6:9">Kafɔɔ lapɛ ɔlaa nlɛ, “Nunua Yaa kpee nnɛɛ nii osie.”<verse eid="NEH 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 6:10" />Dii ninwii lakyɛ Delaia obisuɔtɔbi Semaia, aale ni Mehetabel ɔwa leyo, nnwɔ baasɛɛ baakpee ni di nnwɔɔ omu nɔɔ leyo. Ni aabuɛ alɛ, “Ta bukyaka di Yaa leyo kamɛ, di olekatakɔ nwu kamɛ, faata busɛɛ olekatakɔ nwu n-yoko, diekye batii kɔwa fɔ ɔbalo- ku kakyɛ bɔɔwa fɔ ɔbalo.”<verse eid="NEH 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 6:11" />Kafɔɔ labuɛ nlɛ, “Osuɔtɔ fɛ ami okle katoso nsifi? Ee otii fɛ ami okle kabuo di olekatakɔ alɛ ɔɔlaafũ nkpa nɔɔ? Namakyɛ!” <verse eid="NEH 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 6:12" />Latofo nlɛ Yaa ditakpee nwɔ kɔtɔ, kafɔɔ aabuɛ ɔlaa aatɛ di suoto nii ta Tobia ku Sanbalat niatɔɔ koto alɛ abla ni nkpo. <verse eid="NEH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 6:13" />Baatɔɔ koto alɛ akpee mi lɛyɛkɛ di mmle kabla ni okpile di nle mmle ɔbla kamɛ, mantɛɛ leyooto kpile mankpɔnɔfɔsa mi.<verse eid="NEH 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 6:14" />Oo Yaa nii, nyuma Tobia ku Sanbalat, ta lɛsaa le batɔɔbla ni oso; nyuma kafɔɔ Yaa ɔlaa buɛtɛtɛ-sanko Noadia ku Yaa ɔlaa babuɛtɛtɛ ba ninkomiɛ alɛ bakpee mi ni difu.<verse eid="NEH 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔkpɛ Nwu Kayɛntɛlekɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 6:15" />Nioso oyoyiɛ nwu otofo laloo di Yuda batii kɔwɛntɛ ko manlɛɛ ni Elul, afosi-anyɔ dii nɔɔnle suoto, di ayi afosi-anɔɔ ayi anyɔ kamɛ. <verse eid="NEH 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 6:16" />Di balo loo bamuu lanu ni nle mmle yi, nnle be mmuu niɛmana wo diekyi ni layɛkɛ, nnɛɛ lafee ma, diekye baanya alɛ ku Yaa loo lɛkyakaako baabla ɔkpɛ wɔ mmle.<verse eid="NEH 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 6:17" />Diɛkyakaa nii, di obe nwu kamɛ yi, Yuda banɔɔfotii-kplɛ nwu latookyesee Tobia akũ kpinwu, kanya didiki kafɔɔ latookye Tobia ɔkyɛ kaatɔɔta ma. <verse eid="NEH 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 6:18" />Diekye batii kpinwu niawɛ ni di Yuda lasiɛ nwɔ di ntam kalɔ, ta ɔlɔ̀ nɔɔ niale ni Ara obisuɔtɔbi Sekania, di obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Yohanan kafɔɔ layɔ ni Berekia obisankobi Mesulam oso. <verse eid="NEH 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 6:19" />Diɛkyakaa ni yi, baatɔɔtɛɛ letofo di sɛsabla nɔɔ biene suoto, baatɔɔtɔkɔ nwɔ sɛlaa se nimbuɛ ni kafɔɔ. Ni di Tobia lakpana akũ aakyesee alɛ okpee mi lɛyɛkɛ nɛ.<verse eid="NEH 6:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NEH 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="NEH 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NEH 7:1" />Baaloo ni oyoyiɛ nwu ose letofo, lakpee ni akloo kafɔɔ di aba ninya yi, ni baadiki n-yoko banyuntɛ ku sinu basantɛ ku Lewi batii nɛ. <verse eid="NEH 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NEH 7:2" />Layɔ obiloo-suɔtɔbi Hanani ku Hanania niale ni okpoo katanikokɔ bakpɛtɛ kanyayilatɛ nwu lase di Yerusalem kanya. Diekye aale osuɔtɔ wɔ niawɛ ni onukwale an-yɛkɛ ni Yaa kafɔɔ anlenkee ni batii kpinwu. <verse eid="NEH 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NEH 7:3" />Ni latɔkɔ ma nlɛ, “Bitanta baasɛkɛtɛ Yerusalem n-yoko nwu dilaase di obe wɔ di kufĩ kamabe nii. Di obe wɔ di n-yoko banyuntɛ lekple bakpe ni di ɔkpɛ kamɛ, biɛta ma basɛɛ n-yoko nwu, baakpee mi abɔsaa. Bidiki kafɔɔ batii ba ninsi ni di Yerusalem fɛ banyuntɛ, bawo bawɛ di sɛkpɛ lɛma kamɛ di bawo kafɔɔ bawɛ di ayo lɛma amu ɔlɔɔkɔ.”<verse eid="NEH 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Batii Ba Niakye Sɛlanle Kamɛ Baawa Ni Ayooto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NEH 7:4" />Okpoo kplɛ nwu nfɛ lamuɔ, sebo late kafɔɔ, kafɔɔ batii kafui niawɛ nwu kaamɛ, di obe wɔ manadise ni ayo nwu letofo. <verse eid="NEH 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NEH 7:5" />Nioso Yaa nii layɔ ni aakpee mi di otu kamɛ alɛ nsiisa banɔɔfotii-kplɛ, banɔɔfotii ku batii ba ninaa ni n-yilakɔ nta ayooto ɔkpana di ayo lɛma kanya. Lanya batii kasale ba niakye sɛlanle kamɛ baawa ni ayooto kukũ nwu. Nnya nle lanya baakpana ni kaamɛ:<verse eid="NEH 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NEH 7:6" />Nnya nsɔ be batii niakye ni sɛlanle kamɛ baawa ni, mba niale ni balanle di Babel ɔka Nebukadnesar lakpaa aasifiko ni sɛlanle kamɛ (baapɛ baakplɛ baawa ni Yerusalem ku Yuda, obiala lasifi okpoo nɔɔ omu, <verse eid="NEH 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NEH 7:7" />baawa ku Serubabel, Yesua, Nehemia, Asaria, Raamia, Nahamani, Mordekai, Bilsan, Misperet, Bigwai, Nehum ku Baana):</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 7:7" />
  <para style="p" vid="NEH 7:7">Israel basuɔtɔ ayooto ninle mba nɛ:<verse eid="NEH 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <table>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NEH 7:8" />Paros banantii</cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">nkpe nnyɔ kɔlafa afosi- akuɛnsĩ-banyɔ</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">   <verse eid="NEH 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NEH 7:9" />Sefatia banantii </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">alafa atiɛ afosi- akuɛnsĩ-banyɔ</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">   <verse eid="NEH 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NEH 7:10" />Ara banantii </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">alafa akuɔ afosi-anɔɔ-banyɔ</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">   <verse eid="NEH 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NEH 7:11" />Pahat-Moab banantii (kuofe ni di Yesua ku Yoab kɔna suoto) </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">nkpe nnyɔ alafa-anɛ-lefosi-banɛ</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">   <verse eid="NEH 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NEH 7:12" />Elam banantii</cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">kakpe alafa anyɔ-afosi-anɔɔ-bana</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">   <verse eid="NEH 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NEH 7:13" />Satu banantii</cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">alafa anɛ afosi-ana-banɔɔ</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">   <verse eid="NEH 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NEH 7:14" />Sakai banantii</cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">alafa akuɛnsĩ-afosi-akuɔ</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">   <verse eid="NEH 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NEH 7:15" />Binui banantii </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">alafa akuɔ-afosi ana-banɛ</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">   <verse eid="NEH 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NEH 7:16" />Bebai banantii </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">alafa akuɔ-afosi anyɔ-banɛ</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">   <verse eid="NEH 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NEH 7:17" />Asgad banantii </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">nkpe nnyɔ-alafa-atiɛ-afosi anyɔ-banyɔ</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">   <verse eid="NEH 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NEH 7:18" />Adonikam banantii </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">alafa akuɔ-afosi-akuɔ-bakuɛnsĩ</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">   <verse eid="NEH 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NEH 7:19" />Bigwai banantii </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">nkpe nnyɔ afosi-akuɔ-bakuɛnsĩ</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">   <verse eid="NEH 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NEH 7:20" />Adin banantii </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">alafa akuɔ afosi- anɔɔ-banɔɔ</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">   <verse eid="NEH 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NEH 7:21" />Ater banantii (kuofe ni di Hesekia kɔna suoto) </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">afosi-anaasĩ-banɛ</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">   <verse eid="NEH 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NEH 7:22" />Hasum banantii </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">alafa atiɛ afosi-anyɔ-banɛ</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">   <verse eid="NEH 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NEH 7:23" />Besai banantii</cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">alafa atiɛ afosi-anyɔ-bana</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">   <verse eid="NEH 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NEH 7:24" />Harif banantii </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">kɔlafa lefosi-banyɔ</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">   <verse eid="NEH 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NEH 7:25" />Gibeon banantii </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">afosi anaasĩ-banɔɔ</cell>
    </row>
  </table>
  <para style="b" vid="NEH 7:25">
    <verse eid="NEH 7:25" />
  </para>
  <table>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NEH 7:26" />Betlehem ku Netofa basuɔtɔ </cell>
      <cell style="tcr2" align="end">kɔlafa afosi-anɛ-banɛ</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">   <verse eid="NEH 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NEH 7:27" />Anatot basuɔtɔ </cell>
